The Power Vacuum

[en.FOCUS_C08_FILL_IN_THE_GAPS_desc]
Trixie has occupied the Baltimare, providing a haven for the remnants of the gangs. But to get to Baltimare, the gangsters must pass through Fillydelphia - where we can intercept them.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_FILL_IN_THE_GAPS]
查漏补缺

[zh.FOCUS_C08_FILL_IN_THE_GAPS_desc]
特丽克西占领了巴尔的马，为黑帮残党提供了庇护所。不过黑帮分子想去巴尔的马，必须要通过小马德菲亚——我们也就要在这里拦截他们。

